C7.2 LOG Planck+DESI w_a in the text (l.556) vs Table (l.526-540)
  text: wa = 1.33 +0.79 -0.56; table: wa = -1.33 +0.79 -0.56
  sign differs: yes; errors identical: True
  away-from-zero ratio 1.33 / 0.56 = 2.38 uses the error on the side AWAY from zero; with the table sign the facing error is 0.79: 1.68 sigma
